<title>GERMANY: German Duerr gets 260 mln dmk contract from Audi.</title>
<headline>German Duerr gets 260 mln dmk contract from Audi.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German plant manufacturing group Duerr AG said on Tuesday it had won a contract worth more than 260 million marks from Volkswagen AG unit Audi to build a spraying unit in Brasil.</p>
<p>In a mandatory statement, the company said the contract had been awarded to its Duerr Systems GmbH unit.</p>
<p>The Curitiba was scheduled for completion at the end of 1998 and would have capacity to spray up to 160,000 Audi A3, Volkswagen Vento and Golf models a year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
